---
import { SITE } from "@/config";
const { giscus } = SITE;
const configured = !!(giscus.repo && giscus.repoId && giscus.categoryId);
const prefillText = `giscus: {
  repo: "${giscus.repo || "xiaozhaorg/Blog"}",
  repoId: "",
  category: "${giscus.category}",
  categoryId: "",
  mapping: "${giscus.mapping}",
  reactionsEnabled: "${giscus.reactionsEnabled}",
  inputPosition: "${giscus.inputPosition}",
  lang: "${giscus.lang}",
}`;
---
<section class="giscus-wrap">
  <div class="giscus-title">
    <h3>💬 评论</h3>
    {configured ? (
      <p class="hint">基于 GitHub Discussions，支持 GitHub 账户直接留言</p>
    ) : (
      <p class="hint">评论系统待启用，请在 <code>src/config.ts</code> 中填入 Giscus 参数</p>
    )}
  </div>

  {configured ? (
    <script
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo={giscus.repo}
      data-repo-id={giscus.repoId}
      data-category={giscus.category}
      data-category-id={giscus.categoryId}
      data-mapping={giscus.mapping}
      data-strict="0"
      data-reactions-enabled={giscus.reactionsEnabled}
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position={giscus.inputPosition}
      data-theme="preferred_color_scheme"
      data-lang={giscus.lang}
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
  ) : (
    <ol class="giscus-setup">
      <li>
        确保你的博客仓库已开启 Discussions：仓库 <code>Settings → General → Features</code> 勾选 <b>Discussions</b>
      </li>
      <li>
        打开 <a href="https://giscus.app/zh-CN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">giscus.app</a> 填写：
        <ul>
          <li>仓库：<code>{giscus.repo || "xiaozhaorg/Blog"}</code></li>
          <li>页面 ↔️ discussion 映射：<code>pathname</code></li>
          <li>Discussion 分类：<b>General / Announcements</b>（推荐 Announcements，只有维护者能开新帖）</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        把页面生成的 <code>data-repo</code>、<code>data-repo-id</code>、<code>data-category</code>、<code>data-category-id</code> 填入
        <code> src/config.ts </code> 里的 <code>giscus</code> 字段。
      </li>
      <li>
        当前预填：<br />
        <pre set:text={prefillText}></pre>
      </li>
    </ol>
  )}
</section>

<style>
  .giscus-wrap {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }
  .giscus-title h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .giscus-title .hint {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .giscus-setup {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 6%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem 1rem 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .giscus-setup > li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .giscus-setup ul {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  .giscus-setup code,
  .giscus-setup pre {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--color-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .giscus-setup pre {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .giscus-setup a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>
